{"id": "1961", "title": "天龙大哥大", "author": "终雨", "category": "其他类型", "count": 224, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/1/1961.htm", "intro": "“天龙大哥大？那是谁？”\r\n　　“知道大哥大什么意思吗？”\r\n　　“当然！大哥大不就是大哥的大哥嘛！”\r\n　　“那不就得了！天龙大哥大就是天龙大哥的大哥了！”\r\n　　“晕！那谁才是天龙的大哥？难不成是少林寺的方丈？”\r\n　　“那是带头大哥好不好……天龙大哥自然是萧峰了！”\r\n　　“哦~~~可是，我记得萧峰的大哥好像是辽王耶律什么的啊？”\r\n　　“呃……那是结拜的，不算！我这是亲亲的大哥！”\r\n　　“可貌似原著中没有这一号人啊？”\r\n　　“……你小子专门来跟我抬杠的是不是！我是作者，我说有就有！你给我闪一边去！”\r\n　　“…………”", "base": "files/article/html/1/1961", "chapters": [{"title": "作品相关", "volume": true}, {"title": "上架感言！", "file": "209959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "001 乔峰大哥", "file": "209964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002 武功", "file": "209969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003 进少林", "file": "209973.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004 经书何在", "file": "209977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005 俗家弟子", "file": "209982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006 终得易筋", "file": "209985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007 因蛇而起 1", "file": "209988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008 因蛇而起 2", "file": "209993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009 因蛇而起 3", "file": "209997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010 暴打慧明", "file": "210000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011 逐出少林 1", "file": "210004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012 逐出少林 2", "file": "210008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013 乔峰授艺 1", "file": "210012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014 乔峰授艺 2", "file": "210016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015 乔峰授艺 3", "file": "210020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016 老爹授艺 1", "file": "210022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017 老爹授艺 2", "file": "210025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018 老爹授艺 3", "file": "210031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019 老爹授艺 4", "file": "210037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020 老爹授艺 5", "file": "210040.html", "available": false}, {"t